  "text": "Move to Nav Bravo.",
  "dur": 2.51
 },
 {
  "id": "bravo_derelict",
  "who": "ANVIL",
  "text": "That hull on your left was Tomas. Nineteen years in the sand. Don't stop to look.",
  "dur": 7.04
 },
 {
  "id": "drill_01",
  "who": "RATCHET",
  "text": "Dodge drill, kid. That drone is loaded with training sabots. Watch for the glow, then hit shift with A or D.",
